\\ Bars rise, fall, rise again, fall again. Like two triangles glued together. \\

VAR i
VAR m

LDA 0
STA i

>loop
  LDR i
  LDA 21
  LTH
  JCN body
  JMP done

>body
  LDR i
  LDA 10
  MOD
  STA m

  LDR m
  LDA 5
  GTH
  JCN high
  JMP low

>low
  LDR m
  LDA 30
  MUL
  JMP push

>high
  LDA 10
  LDR m
  SUB
  LDA 30
  MUL

>push
  LDR i
  INC
  STA i
  JMP loop

>done
PRT
BRK